  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2606.03 Additional Requirements",
  "priorExpiration": "2000-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2606.03 Additional Requirements. Each applicant for a local permit to sell permissible fireworks shall submit the following along with the permit application set forth in Saf-C 2606.02:\n\n(a) The permit fee established by the municipality, if any; and\n\n(b) A copy of a valid permit for the sale of fireworks issued pursuant to title 18 of the United States Code.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
